* Use `xdg-mime query default x-scheme-handler/mailto` to figure out the
  default mailer and then make appropriate calls like `thunderbird -mail
  "message-id://<ID_OF_MESSAGE>"` for Thunderbird
* Have a setting to specify/override the mailer, and support gmail with
  a "xdg-open" call that opens the corresponding search:
  https://mail.google.com/mail/#search/rfc822msgid:QUOTED_MESSAGE_ID
